      "content": "It is completely understandable why you feel the effort to \"fix\" this is futile when it feels like the foundation itself is gone. Acknowledging that the old way of being might be over is a profound and valid realization. Instead of focusing on \"fixing\" what was, perhaps the goal right now can be to simply exist without the pressure of performance. Allow yourself permission to feel this emptiness without the immediate need to make it productive or meaningful.",
      "source": "target",
